---
/**
 * "How Aging Works" section — homepage section 2 (Figma node 2:83).
 *
 * Structure (fixed, from Figma):
 *   full-width section, bg-page, pt-[120px] pb-[64px]
 *   └─ max-w-container two-column layout (stacks on mobile)
 *      ├─ LEFT  shrink-0
 *      │   ├─ eyebrow + h2 (with accent "fancy stuff" span) + body
 *      │   ├─ dashed line + image (489×326, rx 32) + dashed line + terminal circle
 *      │   └─ h3 pullquote (centered)
 *      └─ RIGHT flex-1
 *          ├─ 3 × Bordered Card (with dashed connectors between)
 *          │   header band  — label, bg + text colour per card
 *          │   body         — number (accent) + title + description
 *          │   meta column  — cost badge + evidence badge (40 % opacity)
 *          ├─ body copy (2 paragraphs)
 *          └─ primary CTA button
 *
 * Copy is baked in (single-page, client-specific content).
 * Do NOT fork this widget per page.
 */

import Heading from '~/components/ui/Heading.astro';
import Text from '~/components/ui/Text.astro';
import Button from '~/components/ui/Button.astro';
import Card from '~/components/ui/Card.astro';

export interface Props {
  id?: string;
}

const { id = 'how-aging-works' } = Astro.props;

// ── Bucket card data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const buckets = [
  {
    label: 'Fill this first',
    labelBg: 'bg-card-mist',
    labelTextColor: 'text-secondary',
    shadowClass: 'shadow-card',
    number: '01',
    title: 'The Basics',
    description: 'Move. Eat well. Sleep. Stay connected. The four pillars.',
    cost: 'Free',
    evidence: 'Strongest evidence',
  },
  {
    label: 'Then this',
    labelBg: 'bg-card-mist',
    labelTextColor: 'text-secondary',
    shadowClass: 'shadow-card-mist',
    number: '02',
    title: 'Measure & ask',
    description: 'Blood pressure. A1c. DEXA. Coronary calcium. Deprescribing.',
    cost: 'Mostly covered',
    evidence: 'Moderate evidence',
  },
  {
    label: 'And then this. But most people start here.',
    labelBg: 'bg-cta-pink',
    labelTextColor: 'text-cta-pink',
    shadowClass: 'shadow-card-pink',
    number: '03',
    title: 'The fancy stuff',
    description: 'IV drips. Peptides. Whole-body MRI. Cancer panels. Fifty supplements.',
    cost: 'Thousands',
    evidence: 'Weakest evidence',
  },
];
---

<section {...id ? { id } : {}} class="not-prose w-full">
  <div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-container flex-col gap-10 px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 md:px-16 md:pt-[120px] md:pb-16 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16 lg:px-[120px]">
    {/*
      No lg:items-start here — both columns default-stretch so the left
      column can grow to match the right columns full height.
    */}

    {/* ── LEFT COLUMN ── */}
    {/*
      Figma 2:112 — outer wrapper self-stretches; inner container fills full
      height so the flex-1 spacer pushes the pullquote to the very bottom.
    */}
    <div class="flex w-full shrink-0 lg:max-w-[49%]">
      <div class="flex h-full w-full flex-col items-center gap-6">

        {/* Eyebrow + Heading + Body — shrink-0 so they dont compress */}
        <div class="flex w-full shrink-0 flex-col items-start gap-8">
          <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-4">
            <Heading variant="eyebrow">where your resources go</Heading>
            <Heading variant="h2">
              Do the basics first.<br />
              Then earn the <span class="text-accent">fancy stuff.</span>
            </Heading>
          </div>
          <Text>
            The interventions with the strongest evidence in longevity medicine are also the
            cheapest, and almost nobody does them, because there is nothing to sell. Start
            by finding out where you actually stand. Then fill the first bucket. Everything
            else can wait its turn.
          </Text>
        </div>

        {/*
          Figma 264:8 — dashed line, image, dashed line, terminal circle.
          Lines stretch (flex-1) so the pullquote stays at the bottom of the
          left column. Image is 489×326, rx=32, inset ~51px each side (~83%).
          CSS repeating-linear-gradient reproduces the Figma dots exactly:
          8.93px filled dot, 8.93px gap, color #E4E2DA.
          Terminal circle matches Figma r=13.33px.
        */}
        <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-2.5 self-stretch lg:min-h-[80px] lg:flex-1">
          <div
            class="hidden min-h-[78px] w-[3px] flex-1 lg:block"
            style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #E4E2DA 0, #E4E2DA 8.93px, transparent 8.93px, transparent 17.86px);"
          ></div>

          <!-- TODO: replace with <Image> when asset is ready -->
          <div
            class="w-[83%] max-w-[489px] shrink-0 rounded-[32px] bg-section-grey"
            style="aspect-ratio: 489 / 326;"
            aria-hidden="true"
          />

          <div class="hidden min-h-[78px] flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2.5 lg:flex">
            <div
              class="w-[3px] flex-1"
              style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #E4E2DA 0, #E4E2DA 8.93px, transparent 8.93px, transparent 17.86px);"
            ></div>
            <div class="size-[26.67px] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#E4E2DA]"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Pullquote — stays at the bottom */}
        <Heading variant="h3" class="w-full shrink-0 text-left text-shadow-page lg:text-center">
          Most people start at bucket three.
        </Heading>

      </div>
    </div>

    {/* ── RIGHT COLUMN ── */}
    <div class="flex w-full flex-1 flex-col gap-12 lg:gap-16">

      {/* Bucket cards with dashed connectors */}
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        {buckets.map((bucket, i) => (
          <>
            {i > 0 && (
              <div class="flex h-11 w-full justify-center">
                <div
                  class="w-[5px]"
                  style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #E4EDF2 0, #E4EDF2 8.93px, transparent 8.93px, transparent 17.86px);"
                ></div>
              </div>
            )}

            <Card
              label={bucket.label}
              labelBg={bucket.labelBg}
              labelTextColor={bucket.labelTextColor}
              class={`w-full ${bucket.shadowClass}`}
            >
              {/* Card body — items-center matches Figma vertical alignment, no extra padding (card shell provides gap-4 above and pb-4 below) */}
              <div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">

                {/* Number + title + description */}
                <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-2.5">
                  {/* Number + title row */}
                  <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 font-heading font-normal text-h3 text-shadow-page">
                    <span class="shrink-0 text-accent leading-none">{bucket.number}</span>
                    <span class="text-heading leading-none">{bucket.title}</span>
                  </div>
                  {/* Description */}
                  <Text variant="small" color="inherit" class="text-primary leading-[1.3]">
                    {bucket.description}
                  </Text>
                </div>

                {/* Meta column: cost + evidence */}
                <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-row flex-wrap items-center gap-3 opacity-40 sm:flex-col sm:items-start sm:pl-4">
                  {/* Cost badge */}
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary">
                    {/* Wallet icon */}
                    <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M12.5 4H3V3.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5H12a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1H2a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h10.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zM3 5h9.5v.5H3V5zm9.5 4.5H3v-3h9.5v3zm-2-1.5a.75.75 0 1 1 1.5 0 .75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="type-eyebrow font-sans">{bucket.cost}</span>
                  </div>
                  {/* Evidence badge */}
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-primary">
                    {/* Sparkles icon */}
                    <svg class="size-3.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M6.5 1 7.3 3.2 9.5 4 7.3 4.8 6.5 7 5.7 4.8 3.5 4l2.2-.8L6.5 1zM2.5 8l.5 1.5L4.5 10l-2 .5L2 12l-.5-1.5L0 10l2-.5L2.5 8zM11.5 8l.5 1.5L14 10l-2 .5L11.5 12 11 10.5 9 10l2-.5L11.5 8z"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="type-eyebrow font-sans">{bucket.evidence}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </Card>
          </>
        ))}
      </div>

      {/* Body copy + CTA */}
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <Text>
            They book the IV drip and the full-body scan while their blood pressure goes
            unmeasured and they havent stood up from a chair without their hands in a
            decade. That isnt stupidity. Its what the entire industry sells.
          </Text>
          <Text>
            We are not against bucket three. Dr. Peterson files it under recreational
            anti-aging: if you enjoy it and can afford it, help yourself, same as a
            weekend in Las Vegas. The objection is buying it while bucket one sits empty.
          </Text>
        </div>
        <Button variant="primary" text="Whole Model in Detail" href="/fill-the-first-bucket" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
